  "_comment_projectRequired": "WQ-450: the *Sh keys were held out of this list in 2.22.76 and added here in 2.22.77, in that order deliberately. This list only reports a missing project file - no sync command writes into a project - so requiring the twins before pack/scripts/repair-project-scripts.ps1 existed would have produced drift nothing could clear. Behavior step 66 fails if a twin required here is one the repair script cannot deliver, which is the same mistake in the other direction.",
